  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> War sphere, Squadron Commander; or Warleader sphere, Troop Commander; character level 10th.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> After you roll initiative, you may spend a spell point or expend your martial focus. If you do, squadron members may use your natural d20 roll in place of their own roll. They keep their own modifiers.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/squadron-feats#toc10\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
